Sabırsızlanıyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} do you live around here?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} I'm
{{TAG:0005:0001:}}, and I'm new to town.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I used to live in {{TAG:0011:0002:0000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I needed a change of pace, so I
thought I'd start over somewhere
new.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I hope we become friends!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Wohnst du auch hier in der Gegend?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich bin {{TAG:0005:0001:}} und bin neu hier.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
