EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}It's so nice to meet you!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
My name is {{TAG:0005:0001:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I moved here about a week ago.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
